{"slug":"r-dd-w","ar":"ر ض و","total":73,"core":"pleasure; contentment","forms":[{"ar":"رَّضِىَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":38,"gloss":"To be pleased, satisfied","word":"radiya","ex":{"s":92,"a":21,"p":2,"ar":["وَلَسَوْفَ","يَرْضَىٰ"],"en":"And he is going to be satisfied"}},{"ar":"رِضْوَٰن","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":13,"gloss":"Pleasure, good pleasure (of Allah)","word":"ridwan","ex":{"s":9,"a":21,"p":5,"ar":["يُبَشِّرُهُمْ","رَبُّهُم","بِرَحْمَةٍ","مِّنْهُ","وَرِضْوَٰنٍ","وَجَنَّـٰتٍ","لَّهُمْ","فِيهَا","نَعِيمٌ","مُّقِيمٌ"],"en":"Their Lord gives them good tidings of mercy from Him and approval and of gardens for them wherein is enduring pleasure"}},{"ar":"مَرْضَات","kind":"verbal noun","form":null,"count":5,"gloss":"pleasure, good pleasure","word":null,"ex":{"s":2,"a":207,"p":7,"ar":["وَمِنَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","مَن","يَشْرِى","نَفْسَهُ","ٱبْتِغَآءَ","مَرْضَاتِ","ٱللَّهِ ۗ","وَٱللَّهُ","رَءُوفٌۢ","بِٱلْعِبَادِ"],"en":"And of the people is he who sells himself, seeking means to the approval of Allah. And Allah is kind to [His] servants"}},{"ar":"رَاضِيَة","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"content, pleased","word":null,"ex":{"s":88,"a":9,"p":2,"ar":["لِّسَعْيِهَا","رَاضِيَةٌ"],"en":"With their effort [they are] satisfied"}},{"ar":"يُرْضُ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":3,"gloss":"to please","word":null,"ex":{"s":9,"a":62,"p":4,"ar":["يَحْلِفُونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","لَكُمْ","لِيُرْضُوكُمْ","وَٱللَّهُ","وَرَسُولُهُۥٓ","أَحَقُّ","أَن","يُرْضُوهُ","إِن","كَانُوا۟","مُؤْمِنِينَ"],"en":"They swear by Allah to you [Muslims] to satisfy you. But Allah and His Messenger are more worthy for them to satisfy, if they should be believers"}},{"ar":"ٱرْتَضَىٰ","kind":"verb","form":8,"count":3,"gloss":"to approve, be pleased with","word":null,"ex":{"s":72,"a":27,"p":3,"ar":["إِلَّا","مَنِ","ٱرْتَضَىٰ","مِن","رَّسُولٍ","فَإِنَّهُۥ","يَسْلُكُ","مِنۢ","بَيْنِ","يَدَيْهِ","وَمِنْ","خَلْفِهِۦ","رَصَدًا"],"en":"Except whom He has approved of messengers, and indeed, He sends before each messenger and behind him observers"}},{"ar":"تَرَاض","kind":"verbal noun","form":6,"count":2,"gloss":"mutual consent","word":null,"ex":{"s":4,"a":29,"p":14,"ar":["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","لَا","تَأْكُلُوٓا۟","أَمْوَٰلَكُم","بَيْنَكُم","بِٱلْبَـٰطِلِ","إِلَّآ","أَن","تَكُونَ","تِجَـٰرَةً","عَن","تَرَاضٍ","مِّنكُمْ ۚ","وَلَا","تَقْتُلُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَكُمْ ۚ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","كَانَ","بِكُمْ","رَحِيمًا"],"en":"O you who have believed, do not consume one another's wealth unjustly but only [in lawful] business by mutual consent. And do not kill yourselves [or one another]. Indeed, Allah is to you ever Merciful"}},{"ar":"تَرَٰضَ","kind":"verb","form":6,"count":2,"gloss":"to agree mutually","word":null,"ex":{"s":2,"a":232,"p":12,"ar":["وَإِذَا","طَلَّقْتُمُ","ٱلنِّسَآءَ","فَبَلَغْنَ","أَجَلَهُنَّ","فَلَا","تَعْضُلُوهُنَّ","أَن","يَنكِحْنَ","أَزْوَٰجَهُنَّ","إِذَا","تَرَٰضَوْا۟","بَيْنَهُم","بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ ۗ","ذَٰلِكَ","يُوعَظُ","بِهِۦ","مَن","كَانَ","مِنكُمْ","يُؤْمِنُ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَٱلْيَوْمِ","ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ ۗ","ذَٰلِكُمْ","أَزْكَىٰ","لَكُمْ","وَأَطْهَرُ ۗ","وَٱللَّهُ","يَعْلَمُ","وَأَنتُمْ","لَا","تَعْلَمُونَ"],"en":"And when you divorce women and they have fulfilled their term, do not prevent them from remarrying their [former] husbands if they agree among themselves on an acceptable basis. That is instructed to whoever of you believes in Allah and the Last Day. That is better for you and purer, and Allah knows and you know not"}},{"ar":"مَرْضِيّ","kind":"passive participle","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"pleasing, well-pleasing","word":null,"ex":{"s":19,"a":55,"p":9,"ar":["وَكَانَ","يَأْمُرُ","أَهْلَهُۥ","بِٱلصَّلَوٰةِ","وَٱلزَّكَوٰةِ","وَكَانَ","عِندَ","رَبِّهِۦ","مَرْضِيًّا"],"en":"And he used to enjoin on his people prayer and zakah and was to his Lord pleasing"}},{"ar":"مَّرْضِيَّة","kind":"passive participle","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"pleasing","word":null,"ex":{"s":89,"a":28,"p":5,"ar":["ٱرْجِعِىٓ","إِلَىٰ","رَبِّكِ","ر